<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="google-site-verification" content="s2YUWbGP7cJsI6HUCKRX9YCtbVJVyA1Q1_jsNWj1RHc">
  <title>Score Lab | HVTracker</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/static/site.css?v={{ css_hash }}">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    :root {
      --bg: #f4f1eb;
      --surface: #eae6de;
      --card: rgba(255,255,255,.55);
      --border: #d4cfc5;
      --text: #1a1a1a;
      --muted: #6b6560;
      --accent: #26405e;
      --warm: #b05a3a;
      --green: #2f6846;
      --red: #9b3c3c;
      --amber: #8b6914;
      --font-mono: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, Menlo, monospace;
      --font-sans: "Hanken Grotesk", system-ui, sans-serif;
    }
    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: var(--font-sans);
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .page { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px 48px; }
    .header {
      padding: 18px 0 14px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
      align-items: baseline;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .logo { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; }
    .logo span { color: var(--warm); }
    .meta { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
    .intro {
      padding: 28px 0 18px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr .8fr;
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .intro h1 { font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.06; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .intro p { color: var(--muted); max-width: 760px; }
    .intro-note {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--card);
      padding: 14px 16px;
      font-size: 13px;
    }
    .intro-note strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .stats {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 1px;
      background: var(--border);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }
    .stat {
      background: var(--bg);
      padding: 14px 16px;
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
    }
    .stat .value { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; }
    .stat .label { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; margin-top: 4px; }
    .section { margin-top: 24px; }
    .section h2 {
      font-size: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: baseline;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .section h2 span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 500; }
    .cards {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .card {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--card);
      padding: 14px 16px;
    }
    .card table, .table table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    .card th, .card td, .table th, .table td {
      padding: 8px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(212, 207, 197, .85);
      text-align: left;
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    .card tr:last-child td, .table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono); }
    .delta-up { color: var(--green); font-weight: 700; }
    .delta-down { color: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
    .delta-flat { color: var(--muted); }
    .chip-row { display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 6px; }
    .chip {
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.5);
    }
    .table {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--card);
      overflow-x: auto;
    }
    .table table { min-width: 980px; }
    .table th {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: .05em;
      color: var(--muted);
      padding: 12px 14px 10px;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      background: rgba(244, 241, 235, .98);
    }
    .table td { padding: 12px 14px; }
    .name a { font-weight: 600; }
    .sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
    .score-pair { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: baseline; }
    .score-pair .old { color: var(--muted); }
    .score-pair .new { font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); }
    .breakdown { color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; max-width: 290px; }
    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .intro, .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .stats { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .page { padding: 0 16px 40px; }
      .intro h1 { font-size: 28px; }
      .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  {% include "_site_header.html.j2" %}
  <div class="page">

    <section class="intro">
      <div>
        <h1>Leaderboard change preview</h1>
        <p>This page compares the current public HVTrust ranking with a local-only <span class="mono">trust_score_v2</span> that lightly folds in runtime-trust signals. The main leaderboard is unchanged. This is just our sandbox for checking whether the new formula causes any major upsets.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="intro-note">
        <strong>What changed in v2</strong>
        <div>Small MCP boost, mild dependency and tool-surface complexity penalties, and the biggest adjustment comes from package provenance drift.</div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <section class="stats">
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="value">{{ stats.avg_adjustment }}</div>
        <div class="label">Average v2 adjustment</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="value">{{ stats.upsets }}</div>
        <div class="label">Rank shifts ≥ 10</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="value">{{ stats.improved }}</div>
        <div class="label">Moved up in v2</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat">
        <div class="value">{{ stats.dropped }}</div>
        <div class="label">Moved down in v2</div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Biggest movers <span>Highest absolute rank changes</span></h2>
      <div class="cards">
        <div class="card">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr><th colspan="3">Moved up</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {% for row in top_up %}
              <tr>
                <td class="name"><a href="/agents/{{ row.slug }}/">{{ row.name }}</a><div class="sub">{{ row.display_repo or row.repo }}</div></td>
                <td class="mono">#{{ row.rank }} → #{{ row.rank_v2 }}</td>
                <td class="delta-up mono">+{{ row.rank_v2_delta }}</td>
              </tr>
              {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <table>
            <thead>
              <tr><th colspan="3">Moved down</th></tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              {% for row in top_down %}
              <tr>
                <td class="name"><a href="/agents/{{ row.slug }}/">{{ row.name }}</a><div class="sub">{{ row.display_repo or row.repo }}</div></td>
                <td class="mono">#{{ row.rank }} → #{{ row.rank_v2 }}</td>
                <td class="delta-down mono">{{ row.rank_v2_delta }}</td>
              </tr>
              {% endfor %}
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Full comparison <span>Sorted by current public rank</span></h2>
      <div class="table">
        <table>
          <thead>
            <tr>
              <th>Agent</th>
              <th>Current</th>
              <th>V2</th>
              <th>Delta</th>
              <th>Score change</th>
              <th>Runtime summary</th>
            </tr>
          </thead>
          <tbody>
            {% for row in rows %}
            <tr>
              <td class="name">
                <a href="/agents/{{ row.slug }}/">{{ row.name }}</a>
                <div class="sub">{{ row.display_repo or row.repo }}</div>
              </td>
              <td class="mono">#{{ row.rank }}<div class="sub">{{ row.trust_score }}/100</div></td>
              <td class="mono">#{{ row.rank_v2 }}<div class="sub">{{ row.trust_score_v2 }}/100</div></td>
              <td class="mono {% if row.rank_v2_delta > 0 %}delta-up{% elif row.rank_v2_delta < 0 %}delta-down{% else %}delta-flat{% endif %}">
                {% if row.rank_v2_delta > 0 %}+{% endif %}{{ row.rank_v2_delta }}
              </td>
              <td>
                <div class="score-pair mono">
                  <span class="old">{{ row.trust_score }}</span>
                  <span>→</span>
                  <span class="new">{{ row.trust_score_v2 }}</span>
                </div>
                <div class="sub">adj {{ "%+.1f"|format(row.trust_v2_adjustment or 0) }}</div>
              </td>
              <td>
                <div class="breakdown">{{ row.score_lab_summary }}</div>
                <div class="chip-row">
                  {% for chip in row.score_lab_chips %}
                  <span class="chip">{{ chip }}</span>
                  {% endfor %}
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>
            {% endfor %}
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
